  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-zotero-sync",
      "title": {
        "en": "Zotero Sync",
        "zh": "Zotero 同步"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Files the documents your DSH conversations produce (Markdown notes, PDFs, Office files) into your local Zotero library: items are named after the document's own title, and several files from one sync merge into a single item with each file as an attachment. Reads your library back read-only too — search items, inspect metadata, extract PDF full text, resolve attachment paths, export BibTeX/RIS. Talks to Zotero's built-in local server on 127.0.0.1:23119, so there is no account, no API key and nothing to install inside Zotero. Entry points: each turn's deliverables card, a composer chip, the /zotero command, and the zotero_sync / zotero_library tools. Unchanged files are skipped instead of duplicated.",
        "zh": "把 DSH 对话里产出的文档（Markdown 笔记、PDF、Office 文件）收进本机 Zotero 文库，条目名取文档自己的真标题，一次同步的多个文件合并成一个条目；也能只读检索文库：搜索条目、读元数据、提取 PDF 全文、拿附件本地路径、导出 BibTeX/RIS。直连 Zotero 自带的本地服务 127.0.0.1:23119，无需账号与 API Key，也不用在 Zotero 里装任何东西。入口在每回合交付物卡片、输入框胶囊、/zotero 指令与 zotero_sync / zotero_library 工具；内容未变化的文件自动跳过而不重复建条目。"
      },
      "icon": "./icon.svg",
      "author": "Ycx66",
